status measurement > textbook
axis taxon
value taxon bird
value taxon penguin in bird
fact f1: animal(id: tweety) @ [measurement]
fact f2: flightless_morph(id: tweety) @ [textbook]
rule fly defeasible @ taxon:bird: flies(id: ?x) <- animal(id: ?x)
rule nofly defeasible @ taxon:penguin: ¬flies(id: ?x) <- flightless_morph(id: ?x)
defeats nofly fly
query flies(id: tweety) @ taxon:penguin expect no
